1
00:00:01,430 --> 00:00:02,250
Section five.

2
00:00:03,060 --> 00:00:03,920
Local algorithms.

3
00:00:04,930 --> 00:00:08,490
Their purpose is to expose compact signals before an

4
00:00:08,490 --> 00:00:09,330
expensive decision.

5
00:00:10,740 --> 00:00:14,300
We use phrase extraction and corpus counts, but those

6
00:00:14,300 --> 00:00:17,920
numbers do not establish initiative membership or semantic

7
00:00:17,920 --> 00:00:18,560
understanding.

8
00:00:27,940 --> 00:00:31,160
RAKE splits around stopwords and punctuation.

9
00:00:32,200 --> 00:00:35,580
Word frequency and co-occurrence contribute to phrase scores.

10
00:00:36,360 --> 00:00:38,980
Our configuration considers one to four words,

11
00:00:39,860 --> 00:00:41,020
retains up to twenty candidates,

12
00:00:41,840 --> 00:00:44,640
normalizes duplicates, and checks source spans.

13
00:00:44,900 --> 00:00:46,000
In Orion,

14
00:00:46,940 --> 00:00:50,500
patient intake API and Orion clinical platform each score

15
00:00:50,500 --> 00:00:50,960
nine.

16
00:00:51,820 --> 00:00:54,280
FastAPI and Python score one.

17
00:00:54,780 --> 00:00:57,020
Those are weights, not probabilities.

18
00:01:02,680 --> 00:01:06,340
YAKE was compared offline using local document features such

19
00:01:06,340 --> 00:01:07,100
as position,

20
00:01:07,820 --> 00:01:09,360
capitalization, and frequency.

21
00:01:10,455 --> 00:01:12,815
It is not the production extractor.

22
00:01:14,030 --> 00:01:18,210
Its measured runtime included repeated process startup, so the

23
00:01:18,210 --> 00:01:20,490
ratio is not an intrinsic speed comparison.

24
00:01:22,665 --> 00:01:25,665
Corpus document frequency counts a term once per repository.

25
00:01:26,800 --> 00:01:31,200
That pretest table is different from the concept-document IDF

26
00:01:31,200 --> 00:01:32,460
used in retrieval.

27
00:01:34,195 --> 00:01:37,735
The installed YAKE artifact's licensing also remained an adoption

28
00:01:37,735 --> 00:01:38,215
concern.

29
00:01:43,597 --> 00:01:45,877
A bag of phrases loses relationships,

30
00:01:46,617 --> 00:01:47,757
including the word not.

31
00:01:49,143 --> 00:01:50,563
Purpose prose must survive.

32
00:01:51,510 --> 00:01:54,330
In one historical FastAPI ablation,

33
00:01:55,210 --> 00:01:58,830
adding RAKE phrases used more input tokens without changing

34
00:01:58,830 --> 00:02:00,610
the unwanted secondary labels.

35
00:02:01,476 --> 00:02:05,056
That single case proves neither that phrases always help

36
00:02:05,596 --> 00:02:06,976
nor that they are unnecessary.

37
00:02:09,263 --> 00:02:12,723
The product also has no learned project-clustering engine or

38
00:02:12,723 --> 00:02:14,323
automatically learned rules.
